6.3 Referential Integrity
The database enforces the following constraints.

Every uncertainty.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every calibration.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every bias.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every stag_link.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every verification_link.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every work_link.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every dataset_link.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every provenance.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

Every moderation.instrument_id must exist in instrument.

The version chain must be acyclic.

