12. Validation Engine Design
The registry validates the following.

Validation 1. Instrument validity. Every instrument is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. STAG annotation validity. Every STAG annotation is validated against the STAG schema.

Validation 3. Numerical verification result validity.

Validation 4. Referential integrity. Every foreign key reference must resolve.

Validation 5. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 6. Work resolution. Every work_reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 7. Dataset resolution. Every dataset_reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 8. Provenance completeness.

Validation 9. Audit completeness.

Validation 10. Moderation completeness.

Validation 11. Uncertainty consistency. The uncertainties must be consistent with the operational range.

Validation 12. Calibration consistency. The calibration corrections must be consistent with the known biases.

